{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06354","headline":"光上座廊下衆山五韵 · 李颀","name":"光上座廊下衆山五韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名岳在庑下，吾师居一牀。\n每闻楞伽经，只对清翠光。\n百谷聚雪色，莓苔侵屋梁。\n气盘古壁转，势引幽堦长。\n愿游薜叶下，日见金鑪香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}